    "title": "Galveston law enforcement agencies to take on bigger role in federal immigration enforcement - NewsBreak",
    "text": "6 hours ago GALVESTON COUNTY, Texas — Law enforcement agencies in Galveston County will be taking on a bigger role when it comes to federal immigration enforcement. The Galveston County Sheriff's Office, as well as Precincts 1, 2 and 4, announced they're now part of the Immigration and Customs Enforcement 287(g) program. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
